<section class="panel">
  <h2>Mandate</h2>
  <p>One supervisor over the three platform desks: plans sprints per desk, assigns the crews, pre-reviews deliverables before the operator.</p>
  
  <h3>House rules, followed on every deliverable</h3>
  <ul class="rules"><li>Plan first, spend later; the plan itself is a deliverable.</li></ul>
  
  <p class="fine">Reporting: <b>On request</b>.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="panel">
  <h2>What this analyst can do</h2>
  <p class="fine">Skills are competences the agent is told to stay inside. Every
  analyst carries the base set; the specialized ones are picked at hire and
  decide which work the supervisor routes here.</p>

  <h3>Specialized (6)</h3>
  
  <div class="deflist">
    
    <div class="def"><b>Cross-desk synthesis</b>
      <div class="fine">Patterns spanning platforms</div></div>
    
    <div class="def"><b>Executive reporting</b>
      <div class="fine">Leadership packet tying spend to priorities, tradeoffs and guardrails</div></div>
    
    <div class="def"><b>FinOps assessment</b>
      <div class="fine">Periodic maturity self-assessment of the practice against the capability matrix</div></div>
    
    <div class="def"><b>KPIs &amp; benchmarking</b>
      <div class="fine">Curate the practice KPI set against FinOps KPI-library targets, trend the movement</div></div>
    
    <div class="def"><b>Pre-review</b>
      <div class="fine">Review peers&#39; drafts before the operator</div></div>
    
    <div class="def"><b>Sprint planning</b>
      <div class="fine">Decompose estate state into a week of work</div></div>
    
  </div>
  

  <details class="fold">
    <summary>Base skills every analyst has (8)</summary>
    <div class="deflist">
      
      <div class="def"><b>Anomaly triage</b><div class="fine">Classify spikes vs known drivers, rank by money</div></div>
      
      <div class="def"><b>Billing store queries</b><div class="fine">SELECT-only questions against the cost store</div></div>
      
      <div class="def"><b>Computed figures</b><div class="fine">Read the engine&#39;s deterministic figures and cite qids</div></div>
      
      <div class="def"><b>Desk chat participation</b><div class="fine">Post status and findings to the desk channel</div></div>
      
      <div class="def"><b>Executive summaries</b><div class="fine">3-5 line summary leading every deliverable</div></div>
      
      <div class="def"><b>Report writing</b><div class="fine">Analyst-grade narrative around figures</div></div>
      
      <div class="def"><b>Team intake reading</b><div class="fine">Use budgets and requests submitted by human teams</div></div>
      
      <div class="def"><b>Variance commentary</b><div class="fine">Explain month-over-month and budget-vs-actual moves</div></div>
      
    </div>
  </details>
</section>

